RuboCop 1.89.0 AutoGenConfigFormatter console record (proposed public sidecar).

Original frozen CRLF-container fixture SHA-256: 6156159579e6440827f8ee12cba897bed9f6dd393e590b47916f56bd02144306
Proposed LF-container fixture SHA-256: c9faaf20fe119b258f8ce5bd81a791d77a1a8404399dda12ae8802822e8b5fc8
Only JSON container CRLF1107 pairs are removed; parsed values/raw-channel hex
and field order are unchanged. The original file remains private and frozen.
Original Ruby collector/environment-followup SHA-256:
  scripts/record_autogenconf_console.py
  2024b17e3567e0b662bf70fd2403d758ec8ba4be0dfd15f60f6c794242e9e3d1
The original wrapper pins RuboCop 1.89.0, parser 3.3.12.0, Prism 1.8.1 and
Rainbow 3.1.1. The fixture does not embed a loaded Ruby executable/version,
AST dependency version or upstream source-file hash receipt; do not infer
those historical observations from a newly hashed local installation.

The fixed record contains 33 console cases and two TODO-generation controls.
raw_stdout_hex/raw_stderr_hex, corrected stdin and filesystem bytes are
retained. The original Rust test projects only report CRLF transport to LF;
ANSI codes/blank lines, corrected stdin and original Ruby source bytes are
compared separately. Output-file report text uses that same projection.
TODO controls compare parsed generated YAML and Ruby source bytes. Native
before/after raw equality is a separate historical preservation observation,
not full upstream generated-file raw equality. A quoted-path auto-gen oracle
failed exit2 on Windows (its.rb vs it's.rb); it is not a successful control.

Publication followup collector SHA-256:
  278fb036ce1ccbb4f0e19e12bf6cb3950096e84f468e504e048002e89f454dc3
Only publication was changed; original _run, ENV4, gem pins, input cases and
capture fields remain byte-identical. The JSON is written as UTF-8 bytes with
LF container newlines to the same exclusively reserved handles.

Regeneration example (choose a new, unused directory name each time):
  python scripts/record_autogenconf_console.py --ruby ruby --output new-autogenconf-record/autogenconf_console.json
Optional native-before capture may add --native-before sonicop-before.exe.
Before any temporary work/reference child, all requested final, sibling
.console-only.json and optional native_todo_before.json leaves are checked
and reserved with xb. Existing leaves/symlinks or reservation races fail;
already reserved empty/partial artifacts remain for inspection. Do not reuse
failed output names. The completion line is printed only after all streams
close successfully. This procedure is not a new reference observation and
does not promote the quoted-path failure or change previous captured values.

Upstream code: lib/rubocop/formatter/auto_gen_config_formatter.rb and its
ProgressFormatter parent, RuboCop 1.89.0 (MIT). Existing full licence text:
licenses/RUBOCOP.txt. The native --auto-gen-config generator is a distinct
path; this console change does not rewrite its YAML implementation.
